            "Complete API documentation lives at docs.example.com with interactive examples, code samples in 8 languages, and a built-in API explorer. We provide OpenAPI/Swagger specs, Postman collections, and SDK libraries for JavaScript, Python, Ruby, Go, Java, PHP, .NET, and Rust. Authentication guides, rate limit details, webhook schemas, and the changelog are all linked from the docs home.",
            "Interactive docs with 8 SDKs, OpenAPI spec, Postman collection, and a built-in explorer."),
