            "We maintain SOC 2 Type II, ISO 27001, GDPR, HIPAA, and PCI DSS Level 1 certifications. Annual third-party audits validate our security controls. We provide BAAs for healthcare customers and DPAs for EU customers. Compliance documentation, penetration test reports, and security questionnaires are available through our trust center.",
