            "Cloud (AWS, GCP, Azure), hybrid, and on-prem with Docker, Kubernetes, and Terraform."),
        new("training",
            "What training resources are included with every plan?",
            "Every plan includes self-paced video courses, live webinars every Tuesday and Thursday, certification programs with proctored exams, downloadable PDF guides, in-app interactive tutorials, and API workshops for developers. Enterprise teams also get custom training sessions. The training portal tracks progress and issues completion certificates.",
